{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino Cleanup is a wholesome clean-a-thon platformer with physics-elements and a retro aesthetic.\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/8424681437b6148cdf9d689fe65d6bd2.apng?t=1773110208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/8424681437b6148cdf9d689fe65d6bd2.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/f4c9b21f4d2ddf27ae157658c80647ea.apng?t=1773110208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/f4c9b21f4d2ddf27ae157658c80647ea.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>Toxic goop has spread across the dinosaur land! Suck up the mess with your trusty vacuum and save the dinosaurs trapped in the muck. Jump, dash, vacuum, and explore multiple levels full of physics-based fun in a 3D world with 2D pixel sprites! Can you find the source of the goop and restore balance to the dino world?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/3ebfcd5a4fc2204c6a7eee5406d3388d.apng?t=1773110208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/3ebfcd5a4fc2204c6a7eee5406d3388d.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0Explore multiple levels by platforming, interacting with physics objects using your vacuum, and be rewarded for cleaning each level fully </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/acad5a0f2c249206fa88477c7144a828.apng?t=1773110208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/acad5a0f2c249206fa88477c7144a828.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0Make dinosaur friends by saving them from the goop, and chat with them back at the hub </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/fc361e4ee38b3ccf1935b35cda5614a2.apng?t=1773110208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/fc361e4ee38b3ccf1935b35cda5614a2.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>\u00a0Find hidden collectibles and exchange them for hats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/6786299b8b21005e61071071cc08e6ce.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/6786299b8b21005e61071071cc08e6ce.webm?t=1773110208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0Pull and push physics-based objects using your trusty vacuum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/66dbd715891313924a399c79f8ef71ae.gif?t=1773110208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/66dbd715891313924a399c79f8ef71ae.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>\u00a0Unlock new abilities, revealing new ways to play, explore, and clean more efficiently</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean Giant Dinosaurs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/cca03c5e0b54f6b0fc8add6c9b5a44cb.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" width=638 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/cca03c5e0b54f6b0fc8add6c9b5a44cb.webm?t=1773110208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/cca03c5e0b54f6b0fc8add6c9b5a44cb.mp4?t=1773110208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been covered in goop, which includes giant dinosaurs! Use the environment and all the tools at your disposal to clean every nook and cranny!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Vacuum!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/9c216ce89f2733e148711015de1e6474.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/9c216ce89f2733e148711015de1e6474.webm?t=1773110208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/9c216ce89f2733e148711015de1e6474.mp4?t=1773110208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple kinds of goop to clean in the world, and each affects the world in different ways. Unlock upgrades to your vacuum for overdrive effects specific to each type of goop, providing very different gameplay experiences!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Dinosaur Friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/1a4a33ecd0ab513c7983a3c4c42922fc.gif?t=1773110208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/1a4a33ecd0ab513c7983a3c4c42922fc.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/8424681437b6148cdf9d689fe65d6bd2.apng?t=1773110208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/8424681437b6148cdf9d689fe65d6bd2.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/11290836f15ffd13cfbd2df08853a760.gif?t=1773110208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/11290836f15ffd13cfbd2df08853a760.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/c65cbda2fbec582348dd355e0e5eefe9.apng?t=1773110208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/c65cbda2fbec582348dd355e0e5eefe9.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/03c8f9815321ea3e84ca8ff88c94e766.apng?t=1773110208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/03c8f9815321ea3e84ca8ff88c94e766.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dinosaur world has been covered in goop, trapping lots of cute characters. Save them from the goop with your trusty vacuum and they'll be waiting for you back at the hub. There you can chat with them between levels, buy hats, and restore the Life Tree to unlock new levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/019d3ed918ffc863fa469accf6d54c3b.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" width=640 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/019d3ed918ffc863fa469accf6d54c3b.webm?t=1773110208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/7f16b81e060bdeadc66058df33346381.apng?t=1773110208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/7f16b81e060bdeadc66058df33346381.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/8424681437b6148cdf9d689fe65d6bd2.apng?t=1773110208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/8424681437b6148cdf9d689fe65d6bd2.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/c65cbda2fbec582348dd355e0e5eefe9.apng?t=1773110208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/c65cbda2fbec582348dd355e0e5eefe9.poster.avif?t=1773110208\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 hei